            "text": "theorem representative_slope (B sigma u L : ℝ) (K g : Plane)\n    (hg : g ≠ 0) (horth : ⟪K, g⟫_ℝ = 0) :\n    ⟪representativeFrequency B sigma u L K g, g⟫_ℝ = -sigma * B * u / L"
